The certified folded fields (ticket 34's matrix round) do NOT replay
from the current caches, code, and environment.  Every combination
tried lands in a wrong basin or diverges; the certificates catch each
(the converged-filling check, added this round -- the certified-era
code would have returned the wrong-fill fields silently).

