The garbage-basin E values agree across replays to ~1e-1 Eh while
differing across rule/code variants -- the executions are
deterministic-given-microstate; the certified runs' good basins were
single draws at a basin boundary.  Same input file + same code +
same env does NOT pin the basin on the uncontracted twins.

Consequences (recorded in ticket 34 + map.md):
- run_folded's "deterministic given its inputs" claim is falsified on
